iterations.reply:
I dropped the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `wasi:clocks/wall-clock@0.2.0`, and the runtime rejects any component that imports `aap:caps/http-client`. The approved extension isn't reflected in the grant, so the fetch can't be linked. Once the `with` clause includes the HTTP interface, the import and call can be added back. The node's output is the same either way.

